comment.narrative:
An evaluation was conducted to assess:

1. The digital needs of teachers, school principals, and students;

2. The practical digital skills of 4th-year students;

3. The availability and usage of digital equipment;

4. The relevance of the current curriculum in terms of digital literacy.

